0224+  12FC             ; T COMMAND TOGGLE SINGLE STEPPER (IF INSTALLED)
0225+  12FC             ;-----------------------------------------------
0226+  12FC             ; The single stepper is (now) controlled by bit 7
0227+  12FC             ; of the REFRESH register:
0228+  12FC             ; B7 = 1 single stepper is enabled
0229+  12FC             ; B7 = 0 single stepper is disabled
0230+  12FC             ; 
0231+  12FC             ; The previous version of the single stepper hardware
